(card "exp:F-R2-3_vpin_drop_q80_600s" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:F-R2-3_vpin_drop_q80_600s"
  :body "---\nnav: 26\ntype: experiment\nid: F-R2-3_vpin_drop_q80_600s\nshort_name: vpin_drop_q80_600s\ntitle: \"F-R2-3 — anchor + drop VPIN@600s trailing-cum q80+ (longer window)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: f\nround: r2\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_f__microstructure]]\"\ntrain_nav: 1.8719\ntrain_trade_count: 105\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8571\ntrain_sharpe: 8.5554\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0101\nval_nav_mean: 1.0471\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0585\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: 1.1813\ntest_trade_count: 17\ntest_sharpe: 6.2848\ntest_win_rate: 0.7059\ntest_max_drawdown: -0.0053\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: falsified\noutcome: test_fail\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [microstructure, blacklist]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: 10\ncreated: 2026-05-17T01:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/f, round/r2, axis/microstructure, axis/blacklist, status/falsified, outcome/test_fail, leak/clean, size/medium]\n---\n\n# F-R2-3 — anchor + drop VPIN@600s q80+\n\n> **TL;DR** —— F-R2 sweep with longer (600s vs 300s) VPIN window. train 1.87 < anchor 2.19, test 1.18 < anchor 1.25. 同 lineage failure。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 假设：300s VPIN window 太短易 noise；600s 更稳。\n- 实测：train NAV 反 (300s) 1.96 → (600s) 1.87 略降，test 几乎 tie (1.19 vs 1.18) —— window 长度不是关键变量。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 同 F-R2-1, VPIN window 600s instead of 300s. 105 笔.\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- past-only. `#leak/clean`.\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 1.8719 | 105 | 8.56 | 85.7% | -1.01% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.0471 ± 0.058 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | 1.1813 | 17 | 6.28 | 70.6% | -0.53% |\n| **Δ test NAV vs anchor** | **-0.067 (FAIL)** | -3 | -0.87 | -4.4pp | 0 |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0; train < anchor.\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_f__F-R2-1__vpin_drop_q80_300s]]\n- **competes_with**: [[arc_260516a__team_f__F-R2-2__vpin_drop_q70_300s]]\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `team_f/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (F-R2-3)\n- `cross_team_test_nav_ranking_v2.csv` (F-R2-3)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- VPIN window 300s/600s 不影响 verdict。下次类似 axis 不要再做 window sweep, 先 verify signal-PnL spearman corr > 0.1, 没过就停。\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_f__F-R2-3__vpin_drop_q80_600s.md"
